No "Open" button in editor toolbars

The extension put its "Open" command (the product icon) into the title bar
of every editor. The view is reached from the activity bar (or the secondary
side bar) and the command palette, so the editor toolbars stay free of it.
The diff accept/cancel buttons stay.

